            "sequence": 1
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.player_house.mom.move.002",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "simple",
          "text": "Die Pokémon tragen unsere Sachen. Sie machen das Haus sauber. Das ist praktisch!\n\nDein Zimmer ist oben. Papa hat dir eine neue Uhr gekauft. Schau dir dein Zimmer an und stell die Uhr!",
          "english_gloss": "The movers' Pokémon carry our things and clean up. That is a big help!\n\nYour room is upstairs. Dad bought you a new clock for the move. Go look at your room and set the clock.",
          "cefr": "A1",
          "internal_difficulty": 5,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.pokemon",
            "de.sachen",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.uhr",
            "de.umzug",
            "de.oben"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 6,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "connected",
          "text": "Die Pokémon helfen uns beim Umzug und machen danach alles sauber. Das ist sehr praktisch!\n\nDein Zimmer ist oben. Papa hat dir zum Umzug eine neue Uhr gekauft. Schau dich dort um und stell die Uhr!",
          "english_gloss": "The movers' Pokémon carry our things and clean up. That is a big help!\n\nYour room is upstairs. Dad bought you a new clock for the move. Go look at your room and set the clock.",
          "cefr": "A2",
          "internal_difficulty": 20,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.pokemon",
            "de.sachen",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.uhr",
            "de.umzug",
            "de.oben"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 6,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "natural",
          "text": "Die Pokémon der Umzugshelfer tragen unsere Sachen herein und räumen anschließend alles auf. Wie praktisch!\n\nDein Zimmer ist oben. Papa hat dir anlässlich unseres Umzugs eine neue Uhr gekauft. Schau dich ruhig um und vergiss nicht, die Uhr zu stellen!",
          "english_gloss": "The movers' Pokémon carry our things and clean up. That is a big help!\n\nYour room is upstairs. Dad bought you a new clock for the move. Go look at your room and set the clock.",
          "cefr": "B1",
          "internal_difficulty": 40,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.pokemon",
            "de.sachen",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.uhr",
            "de.umzug",
            "de.oben"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 6,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 2
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.player_house.mom.room_reminder.003",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "simple",
          "text": "Mama: Dein Zimmer ist oben. Schau es dir an!",
          "english_gloss": "Don't you want to see your own room? It is upstairs.",
          "cefr": "A1",
          "internal_difficulty": 5,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.oben",
            "de.neugierig"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "connected",
          "text": "Mama: Möchtest du dein eigenes Zimmer sehen? Es ist oben.",
          "english_gloss": "Don't you want to see your own room? It is upstairs.",
          "cefr": "A2",
          "internal_difficulty": 20,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.oben",
            "de.neugierig"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "natural",
          "text": "Mama: Bist du denn gar nicht neugierig auf dein eigenes Zimmer?",
          "english_gloss": "Don't you want to see your own room? It is upstairs.",
          "cefr": "B1",
          "internal_difficulty": 40,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.oben",
            "de.neugierig"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.player_house.clock.004",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "simple",
          "text": "Die Uhr steht. Stell die richtige Zeit ein!",
          "english_gloss": "The clock has stopped. Set it to the right time and start it.",
          "cefr": "A1",
          "internal_difficulty": 5,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.uhr",
            "de.zeit"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 2,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "connected",
          "text": "Die Uhr ist stehen geblieben. Stell die richtige Zeit ein und starte sie!",
          "english_gloss": "The clock has stopped. Set it to the right time and start it.",
          "cefr": "A2",
          "internal_difficulty": 20,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.uhr",
            "de.zeit"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 2,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "natural",
          "text": "Die Uhr ist stehen geblieben... Am besten stellst du sie richtig und setzt sie wieder in Gang.",
          "english_gloss": "The clock has stopped. Set it to the right time and start it.",
          "cefr": "B1",
          "internal_difficulty": 40,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.uhr",
            "de.zeit"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 2,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 4
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.player_house.mom.room.005",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "simple",
          "text": "Mama: Gefällt dir dein Zimmer? Alles ist ordentlich. Unten sind die Pokémon auch fertig.\n\nSchau auf deinen Schreibtisch. Ist alles da?",
          "english_gloss": "How do you like your new room? Everything is tidy. The Pokémon finished moving things downstairs too.\n\nCheck that everything is there on your desk.",
          "cefr": "A1",
          "internal_difficulty": 5,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.schreibtisch",
            "de.ordentlich",
            "de.unten",
            "de.pokemon"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 5,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "connected",
          "text": "Mama: Wie gefällt dir dein neues Zimmer? Alles ist ordentlich. Die Pokémon sind unten auch fertig.\n\nSchau bitte nach, ob auf deinem Schreibtisch alles da ist.",
          "english_gloss": "How do you like your new room? Everything is tidy. The Pokémon finished moving things downstairs too.\n\nCheck that everything is there on your desk.",
          "cefr": "A2",
          "internal_difficulty": 20,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.schreibtisch",
            "de.ordentlich",
            "de.unten",
            "de.pokemon"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 5,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "natural",
          "text": "Mama: Wie gefällt dir dein neues Zimmer? Alles ist ordentlich eingeräumt! Auch unten sind die Pokémon schon fertig. Solche Umzugshelfer sind wirklich praktisch!\n\nPrüf bitte noch, ob auf deinem Schreibtisch alles vollständig ist.",
          "english_gloss": "How do you like your new room? Everything is tidy. The Pokémon finished moving things downstairs too.\n\nCheck that everything is there on your desk.",
          "cefr": "B1",
          "internal_difficulty": 40,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.schreibtisch",
            "de.ordentlich",
            "de.unten",
            "de.pokemon"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 5,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 5
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.arrival.mom.006",
      "variants": [
        {
          "id": "simple",
          "text": "Mama: Wir sind da! Das ist Wurzelheim. Hier wohnen wir jetzt. Du bekommst ein eigenes Zimmer. Gehen wir ins Haus!",
          "english_gloss": "We have arrived in Littleroot! The truck ride must have been tiring. This is our new home, and you get your own room. Let us go inside.",
          "cefr": "A1",
          "internal_difficulty": 5,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.haus",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.lastwagen"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "connected",
          "text": "Mama: Endlich sind wir in Wurzelheim! Die Fahrt im Lastwagen war sicher anstrengend. Hier ist unser neues Haus. Du bekommst ein eigenes Zimmer. Gehen wir hinein!",
          "english_gloss": "We have arrived in Littleroot! The truck ride must have been tiring. This is our new home, and you get your own room. Let us go inside.",
          "cefr": "A2",
          "internal_difficulty": 20,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.haus",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.lastwagen"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "natural",
          "text": "Mama: Da wären wir, in Wurzelheim! Die Fahrt zwischen all unseren Sachen war bestimmt anstrengend. Hier lässt es sich sicher gut leben. Du bekommst sogar dein eigenes Zimmer. Komm, gehen wir hinein!",
          "english_gloss": "We have arrived in Littleroot! The truck ride must have been tiring. This is our new home, and you get your own room. Let us go inside.",
          "cefr": "B1",
          "internal_difficulty": 40,
          "vocabulary_ids": [
            "de.haus",
            "de.zimmer",
            "de.lastwagen"
          ],
          "grammar_note_ids": [],
          "new_vocabulary_budget": 3,
          "minimum_game_progress": {
            "chapter": "arrival",
            "sequence": 0
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "dialogue_id": "littleroot.player_house.mom.quick.007",
      "variants": [
